WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
PRODUCTION: Scene four, take two. Hold for room tone.

00:02.100 --> 00:07.000
INTERN: I have it. One yellow reminder, exactly where you said.

00:07.100 --> 00:12.000
The intern opens the drawer, slides a hand beneath the keyboard, and turns the mug upside down.

00:12.100 --> 00:17.000
INTERN: There is nothing here. Do you want me to put everything back?

00:17.100 --> 00:21.000
The intern restores the mug, keyboard, and drawer in reverse order, then waits beside the ringing phone.

00:21.100 --> 00:23.000
PRODUCTION: Cut. That is the end of the take.
